final stamp = ci.indexOf('stamp_staged_release.sh /tmp/pr-dry-run-stage "\$next"');
expect(stamp, greaterThan(stage),
    reason: 'the stamp rehearsal must run AFTER the stage it stamps');
```

This mirrors how the neighboring guard at line 470 pins ordering (`script.indexOf('/stamp_staged_release.sh"')` relative to the staging call). Non-blocking.
